<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Hi </span></span><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;">{!Lead.FirstName}</span></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;">,</span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Margins in retail and eCommerce are under pressure — rising costs, shrinking loyalty, and legacy systems make it harder to grow. Add in AI adoption pressure and ESG demands, and the challenge gets bigger.</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">At </span></span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="font-weight:700">TechWish Technologies</span></span></span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">, we help retailers modernize by:</span></span></p><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><li style="list-style-type:disc" aria-level="1"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Migrating POS &amp; ERP to cloud-native microservices to cut tech debt</span></span><br><br></li><li style="list-style-type:disc" aria-level="1"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Unifying customer data for real-time loyalty personalization</span></span><br><br></li><li style="list-style-type:disc" aria-level="1"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Deploying AI forecasting to reduce stockouts &amp; markdowns</span></span><br><br></li><li style="list-style-type:disc" aria-level="1"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Embedding ESG compliance tooling for effortless reporting</span></span><br><br></li></ul><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Our modernization frameworks unlock </span></span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="font-weight:700">agility, efficiency, and ROI</span></span></span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"> — without disrupting daily operations.</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Would you like to see how industry peers are driving double-digit improvements?</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Best regards,</span></span><br><font face="arial">{!Lead.OwnerFullName}</font></p>]]></td>
</tr>
